  "title": "Restaurant-Style Tequila Lime Chicken",
  "description": "This spicy, marinated broiled chicken dish is the same as that of a well-known restaurant chain's Tequila Lime Chicken. Enjoy! Serve with rice and pico de gallo salsa, if desired.",
  "authors": [
